WEBVTT

00:02.690 --> 00:03.810
Well then,

00:03.900 --> 00:05.520
have a safe adventure.

00:13.990 --> 00:15.570
Even if we can't defeat it,

00:15.660 --> 00:17.490
we have to do what the top brass tells us.

00:18.410 --> 00:20.660
We're Silver Sword after all.

00:21.790 --> 00:24.580
Is he really going to be okay?

00:25.880 --> 00:28.250
Don't think too much.
Let's just focus on work.

00:29.090 --> 00:33.260
(White Tower)

00:38.260 --> 00:39.470
What should we do?

00:39.930 --> 00:41.980
We're up against a dark god
who uses Dia skills.

00:42.060 --> 00:44.440
Our Sigurth skills alone can't defeat him.

00:45.400 --> 00:46.810
You're not moving?

00:46.900 --> 00:48.980
Well then, I'll make the first move.

00:49.360 --> 00:50.360
(Dragon-serpent Flame)
Ignis!

00:51.740 --> 00:53.650
What kind of child's play is this?

00:53.740 --> 00:54.570
Lululi!

00:54.660 --> 00:56.130
Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!

00:56.130 --> 00:57.530
(The Undying Blesser)
Skill Activate. Sigurth Revive!

00:57.620 --> 00:58.530
(The Undying Blesser)

01:02.500 --> 01:05.250
A skill that grants
regenerative abilities?

01:05.330 --> 01:06.670
How intriguing.

01:07.000 --> 01:09.250
I'll be taking that skill.

01:10.710 --> 01:12.030
Chant. Dia Drain.

01:12.030 --> 01:14.380
(The Giant God's Mirror of Jealousy)
Chant. Dia Drain.

01:14.510 --> 01:15.930
(The Giant God's Mirror of Jealousy)

01:19.140 --> 01:20.890
Lululi! Run!

01:30.860 --> 01:32.860
My staff. It's gone!

01:37.530 --> 01:39.280
I don't need this stick.

01:41.450 --> 01:42.950
Skill Activate!

01:43.040 --> 01:44.750
Sigurth Revive!

01:46.290 --> 01:49.920
No way. I can't activate my skills.

01:50.210 --> 01:53.300
Is that a Dia mark?

01:53.380 --> 01:55.050
Does this mean he is

01:55.550 --> 01:58.640
another relic created by the ancients?

02:05.390 --> 02:11.440
(I May Be a Guild Receptionist,
but I'll Solo Any Boss to Clock Out on Time)

03:34.980 --> 03:37.940
(The Giant God's Swords of Judgment)
Chant. Dia Judge.

03:39.490 --> 03:42.030
Is that a skill that pierces targets?

03:42.110 --> 03:43.410
If they get hit,

03:43.490 --> 03:45.700
Lululi and Lowe will die for sure.

03:46.870 --> 03:48.700
I can't let them

03:48.790 --> 03:50.620
die in a place like this!

03:50.870 --> 03:52.880
I'll take this attack.

03:53.130 --> 03:54.380
You guys use the opening to run.

03:54.670 --> 03:56.170
What do you want to do?

03:56.250 --> 03:58.920
Let's face off, Dark God!

03:59.010 --> 04:00.550
Face off?

04:01.590 --> 04:02.890
Interesting.

04:03.090 --> 04:04.390
Skill Activate!

04:04.640 --> 04:06.560
(The Bloodstained Endbringer)
Sigurth Blood!

04:06.560 --> 04:07.720
(The Bloodstained Endbringer)

04:07.720 --> 04:11.350
A skill that forces
the opponent's attacks on oneself.

04:11.690 --> 04:15.310
We clearly agreed that it can only be used
with my Sigurth Revive.

04:15.730 --> 04:17.820
Are you trying to sacrifice yourself?

04:18.530 --> 04:21.400
Try to take my judgment.

04:24.620 --> 04:28.490
I didn't think you'd be able
to withstand my sword of judgment.

04:29.620 --> 04:31.790
Keep the attacks coming.

04:31.870 --> 04:34.630
I've been trained by Ms. Alina every day,

04:34.710 --> 04:36.290
so I'm pretty tough!

04:37.090 --> 04:38.090
Run.

04:39.460 --> 04:40.460
Lowe!

04:42.510 --> 04:45.050
I'm looking forward to seeing
how long you can last.

04:48.100 --> 04:49.100
Jade!

04:50.930 --> 04:52.350
What are you doing?

04:52.440 --> 04:53.810
Let go of me!

04:54.020 --> 04:56.440
No! Jade!

04:56.520 --> 04:58.480
So in the end, your comrades abandon you?

04:58.570 --> 05:01.400
I have to buy them time to escape.

05:01.490 --> 05:04.200
Serving as a meat shield
for my companions.

05:04.280 --> 05:06.410
That's my duty as a tank.

05:07.700 --> 05:09.830
What incredible vitality.

05:09.910 --> 05:12.200
You're really worth devouring.

05:20.340 --> 05:22.470
Why did you run away
and leave Jade behind?

05:22.550 --> 05:24.010
We have to get back!

05:24.090 --> 05:25.260
Even if we go back,

05:25.340 --> 05:27.390
what can we do?

05:27.640 --> 05:30.600
Our leader risked his life
to secure us a chance to escape!

05:31.100 --> 05:33.850
Of course, we had to run!

05:38.980 --> 05:42.190
Is Jade going to die?

06:04.090 --> 06:06.630
I can't finish this.

06:06.720 --> 06:07.800
If we finish it today,

06:07.890 --> 06:10.010
we can go home on time tomorrow.

06:10.100 --> 06:12.140
We're almost there. Hang in there.

06:13.220 --> 06:16.350
That "almost there" to me
is an incredibly heavy burden.

06:16.440 --> 06:18.350
Please give me wings.

06:18.440 --> 06:20.110
I guess I have no choice.

06:20.440 --> 06:21.520
Here you go.

06:24.990 --> 06:26.530
It's delicious,

06:26.610 --> 06:28.910
but it tastes like an overtime drink.

06:28.990 --> 06:31.830
By the way, it's such a shame, Ms. Alina.

06:31.910 --> 06:32.950
What is?

06:33.040 --> 06:35.000
Well, Lord Executioner.

06:35.080 --> 06:39.630
The Guild actually gave up
on finding Lord Executioner!

06:39.710 --> 06:40.670
What?

06:40.750 --> 06:45.010
I really wanted to see Lord Executioner
integrate into the Silver Sword,

06:45.090 --> 06:46.380
fitting perfectly like a puzzle!

06:47.170 --> 06:49.720
Why did they give up?

06:49.800 --> 06:51.010
By the way, Ms. Alina.

06:51.100 --> 06:52.220
Your pocket...

06:55.720 --> 06:58.190
It's so pretty.

06:59.400 --> 07:01.360
Please don't hide it. Let me see it!

07:01.440 --> 07:02.690
There's nothing to see.

07:02.770 --> 07:04.280
It's just a normal stone that glows.

07:04.480 --> 07:06.690
Normal stones don't glow.

07:06.900 --> 07:07.740
What?

07:07.820 --> 07:09.410
Why is it glowing?

07:10.070 --> 07:12.070
When the owner is on the verge of death,

07:12.160 --> 07:14.120
this crystal shard
will alert other allies.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.290
No way.

07:16.370 --> 07:17.370
It can't be.

07:24.210 --> 07:26.210
Did something happen?

07:26.300 --> 07:28.510
Ms. Alina!

07:30.180 --> 07:32.340
You're an interesting human.

07:32.680 --> 07:33.600
Now then,

07:33.680 --> 07:37.020
how many swords can you take?

07:38.390 --> 07:40.730
I'll probably die here.

07:42.350 --> 07:44.650
If I said I don't hate

07:45.900 --> 07:47.570
that displeased look on her face,

07:47.650 --> 07:50.110
would she hit me with her warhammer?

07:50.910 --> 07:54.280
Ever since I first saw her
in the depths of the dungeon,

07:54.370 --> 07:57.200
I've been hopelessly in love
with Ms. Alina.

07:57.660 --> 07:59.660
The way she seems mature at first glance,

08:00.250 --> 08:02.920
but is actually more childish
than anyone else.

08:03.630 --> 08:07.880
The way she tries to solve
everything troublesome by force.

08:09.300 --> 08:10.930
And when she goes to work,

08:11.510 --> 08:13.340
that dead-eyed look of hers.

08:13.800 --> 08:16.390
That scary expression when she's angry.

08:17.100 --> 08:20.430
That refreshed look
when she clocks out on time.

08:21.270 --> 08:24.270
So, just a little longer.

08:24.360 --> 08:26.360
I want to see her some more.

08:27.400 --> 08:29.900
Your attacks,

08:29.990 --> 08:32.610
compared to Ms. Alina's warhammer,

08:32.950 --> 08:35.530
don't hurt or itch at all!

08:38.160 --> 08:41.330
(Guild Headquarters Crystal Gate)

08:43.290 --> 08:44.630
Stop!

08:45.040 --> 08:46.750
What are you doing here at this hour?

08:47.750 --> 08:49.050
A receptionist?

08:49.420 --> 08:52.050
This gate only leads to the dungeon.

08:52.130 --> 08:54.180
If you want to go somewhere else,

08:54.260 --> 08:55.890
use the one at Ifuru.

08:56.970 --> 08:58.010
What should I do?

08:58.100 --> 08:59.520
I have to hurry.

08:59.600 --> 09:01.730
But if the guards find me out,

09:01.810 --> 09:03.100
I'll be fired for real this time.

09:13.700 --> 09:15.320
Adventurers are bound

09:15.870 --> 09:17.030
to die eventually anyway.

09:18.580 --> 09:21.910
It's their fault for choosing
such a risky lifestyle.

09:22.200 --> 09:23.750
But I'm different.

09:23.830 --> 09:27.000
I became a receptionist to avoid risks.

09:27.080 --> 09:28.460
Even if I had to work overtime,

09:28.540 --> 09:30.500
even though it was tough,
I still pushed through.

09:30.920 --> 09:32.300
For someone like me,

09:32.760 --> 09:34.630
why would I give up my life

09:34.720 --> 09:38.300
and my stable lifestyle
as a receptionist for them?

09:38.890 --> 09:41.390
I'm not obligated to save them.

09:41.470 --> 09:42.680
Just leave them be.

09:55.320 --> 09:56.530
Skill...

09:56.820 --> 09:59.200
Skill Activate!

10:00.120 --> 10:01.240
She has a skill!

10:01.330 --> 10:03.580
That huge warhammer...

10:03.660 --> 10:05.290
Could you be the Executioner?

10:05.370 --> 10:07.670
There's no turning back now.

10:07.750 --> 10:09.670
I'm such an idiot.

10:09.750 --> 10:10.920
A total fool.

10:11.500 --> 10:12.960
Get out of my way!

10:14.840 --> 10:15.970
Otherwise,

10:16.720 --> 10:18.390
I'll send you flying!

10:29.110 --> 10:30.110
Lowe!

10:30.560 --> 10:32.400
Hang in there!

10:33.230 --> 10:35.360
There's so much blood.

10:36.360 --> 10:38.860
My staff and skills were taken away.

10:39.780 --> 10:41.200
I can't...

10:42.200 --> 10:44.250
do anything anymore.

10:45.330 --> 10:47.330
Don't worry about me.

10:47.830 --> 10:49.500
Run away on your own.

10:49.580 --> 10:51.250
No!

10:55.670 --> 10:57.050
If you don't come with me,

10:57.130 --> 10:59.010
I will never leave this place!

10:59.430 --> 11:01.600
I will never run away again!

11:18.490 --> 11:20.110
Ms. Alina?

11:20.450 --> 11:21.660
Thank goodness.

11:21.740 --> 11:23.370
I'm glad you're both safe.

11:23.950 --> 11:25.290
Drink this.

11:26.580 --> 11:27.830
I can't thank you enough.

11:27.910 --> 11:30.460
Ms. Alina, please save Jade!

11:30.790 --> 11:31.750
Jade!

11:31.830 --> 11:33.540
Jade's going to die!

11:35.420 --> 11:39.090
Our leader is fighting
the Dark God Silha right now.

11:39.180 --> 11:40.220
Dark God?

11:40.300 --> 11:42.010
He devours people's souls

11:42.090 --> 11:44.510
and can use several Dia skills.

11:45.430 --> 11:46.430
Our leader...

11:46.520 --> 11:48.980
In order to buy us time to escape...

11:49.480 --> 11:50.600
I see.

11:51.310 --> 11:52.440
I got it.

11:53.400 --> 11:54.900
Leave the rest to me.

12:08.040 --> 12:09.120
Jade!

12:16.210 --> 12:19.760
We will definitely come back safely.

12:21.130 --> 12:23.890
You're kidding, right?

12:26.140 --> 12:27.260
Hey.

12:27.600 --> 12:29.230
Come on, wake up.

12:29.310 --> 12:30.640
Don't just sit there.

12:30.730 --> 12:32.140
Answer me.

12:32.980 --> 12:34.110
I'm talking to you!

12:44.280 --> 12:47.080
I'm surprised you dodged my attack.

12:47.160 --> 12:50.580
Looks like I've got
another interesting one.

12:50.870 --> 12:53.040
This is Dark God.

12:53.120 --> 12:56.000
Are you here to save that man?

12:56.090 --> 12:57.500
Unfortunately, you're too late.

12:58.090 --> 13:01.630
But for a human,
he sure made it enjoyable for me.

13:01.970 --> 13:03.840
This guy.

13:03.930 --> 13:05.720
I can't believe that this guy...

13:06.140 --> 13:07.850
Skill Activate.

13:08.310 --> 13:10.020
Dia Break!

13:10.100 --> 13:11.980
(Warhammer of the Giant God)

13:12.600 --> 13:14.190
I swear

13:14.270 --> 13:16.020
I'll kill you!

13:24.410 --> 13:26.200
How interesting.

13:26.280 --> 13:29.990
A human like you can use skills
at the same level as mine?

13:31.620 --> 13:34.170
Chant. Dia Judge!

13:54.560 --> 13:56.520
Sigurth Wall!

14:01.230 --> 14:04.030
You're tougher than I expected.

14:04.110 --> 14:05.700
Die!

14:30.140 --> 14:31.430
You're alive?

14:32.100 --> 14:33.930
- I fell asleep for a moment.
- What?

14:34.310 --> 14:35.850
Because I heard

14:36.310 --> 14:39.110
that dangerous sound emitted

14:39.190 --> 14:41.150
when Ms. Alina swung her warhammer.

14:41.650 --> 14:43.820
Now that I've heard your voice,

14:44.400 --> 14:46.900
I can't die here, naturally.

14:48.490 --> 14:49.870
I'm pretty tough, you know.

14:49.950 --> 14:52.240
There's no way I'd die easily.

14:53.540 --> 14:54.700
Thank goodness.

14:55.200 --> 14:56.410
Jade.

15:01.920 --> 15:03.800
Wait!

15:04.880 --> 15:07.340
It's really you.

15:15.020 --> 15:15.850
This is for you.

15:15.930 --> 15:17.350
I was working overtime,

15:17.440 --> 15:18.850
so I drank it a little.

15:18.940 --> 15:20.100
But it's better than nothing, right?

15:20.190 --> 15:21.900
Wouldn't this be
an indirect kiss with Ms. Alina?

15:21.980 --> 15:23.320
I'll smash it.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.860
Then I'll gladly accept it.

15:32.200 --> 15:35.370
I didn't think you could hurt me.

15:35.450 --> 15:38.580
But don't think you can beat me with this.

15:39.500 --> 15:40.790
His wound is...

15:40.880 --> 15:42.710
That's Lululi's skill.

15:43.130 --> 15:45.090
As long as we don't
finish him off in one hit,

15:45.170 --> 15:46.880
he can regenerate over and over again.

15:46.960 --> 15:48.590
What kind of skill is that?

15:48.670 --> 15:51.970
It seems that you have
the same level of power

15:52.050 --> 15:55.010
as the people who created me.

15:55.350 --> 15:59.480
In that case,
there's no way you can defeat me.

15:59.730 --> 16:01.190
What do you mean?

16:01.270 --> 16:02.610
Because that bunch,

16:02.690 --> 16:05.400
those foolish humans,

16:05.780 --> 16:08.900
all have been devoured by me.

16:08.990 --> 16:11.910
Then the one who wiped out the ancestors

16:11.990 --> 16:13.410
was Dark God?

16:13.490 --> 16:18.370
Survival of the fittest
is the law of this world.

16:19.250 --> 16:22.330
Chant. Dia Judge!

16:23.710 --> 16:25.170
We can't beat him.

16:26.050 --> 16:28.130
I don't have a shield anymore.

16:28.630 --> 16:30.050
So what?

16:30.420 --> 16:32.800
In the end, I'll be the human shield.

16:33.300 --> 16:34.850
You'll sneak up on him and run away.

16:34.930 --> 16:35.760
No.

16:35.850 --> 16:37.180
I'm the tank.

16:37.260 --> 16:39.100
Let me protect you until the end.

16:39.180 --> 16:40.020
No!

16:40.100 --> 16:40.940
But!

16:41.020 --> 16:41.850
No!

16:41.940 --> 16:44.560
If you say you're the tank,

16:44.940 --> 16:47.020
then as a receptionist,

16:47.110 --> 16:48.980
I also have things I can't back down from.

16:51.450 --> 16:52.780
Ms. Alina!

17:07.380 --> 17:09.710
One day, I swear

17:09.800 --> 17:13.380
I'll live my ideal, peaceful life.

17:13.470 --> 17:15.340
Work leisurely.

17:15.430 --> 17:18.060
Leave work on time every day.

17:18.140 --> 17:19.350
And then,

17:19.810 --> 17:22.310
watch everyone come back safe and sound!

17:22.690 --> 17:24.020
If they don't come back,

17:24.100 --> 17:27.230
I'll bring them back even if it kills me.

17:28.110 --> 17:29.730
I won't let you guys

17:29.820 --> 17:32.950
die in a place like this!

17:38.530 --> 17:39.870
What...

17:40.370 --> 17:41.870
is that light?

17:43.160 --> 17:47.130
A mere human can suppress my power?

17:47.630 --> 17:50.050
Chant. Dia Judge.

17:52.130 --> 17:54.220
You have nowhere to run now.

17:54.300 --> 17:56.680
These thousands of swords
will pierce the heart of my prey

17:56.760 --> 17:59.890
and offer their soul to me!

17:59.970 --> 18:02.980
I'll make sure everyone comes back alive,

18:03.060 --> 18:04.560
whether it's Lululi or Lowe,

18:04.640 --> 18:07.350
or that freaking unkillable tank
over there.

18:08.360 --> 18:09.520
I won't let anyone

18:09.610 --> 18:11.360
die in a place like this!

18:11.440 --> 18:14.070
Tear her apart, my swords!

18:19.490 --> 18:20.870
Alina!

18:31.460 --> 18:33.420
Chant.

18:33.880 --> 18:34.880
Too slow!

18:36.550 --> 18:38.340
You...

18:38.890 --> 18:41.350
In my peaceful life,

18:41.430 --> 18:44.600
no one will ever fail to return again.

18:44.980 --> 18:46.140
Impossible.

18:46.230 --> 18:49.020
How can she surpass
the omnipotent dark god?

18:49.110 --> 18:51.860
For my peaceful life,

18:51.940 --> 18:55.650
die!

18:59.200 --> 19:01.700
The Dark God
that even the ancients couldn't defeat

19:01.780 --> 19:03.540
was actually defeated.

19:05.660 --> 19:08.080
Surprisingly, it went well.

19:08.170 --> 19:10.840
Ordinary people can't do
something like this.

19:12.170 --> 19:15.210
You're just a mere human.

19:15.300 --> 19:18.430
The Dark God must be omnipotent.

19:18.760 --> 19:21.010
You don't know how to give up, do you?

19:21.100 --> 19:22.890
Anyway, it's over for you.

19:22.970 --> 19:24.390
Over?

19:25.430 --> 19:28.810
Do you think there's only
one Dark God in this world?

19:29.350 --> 19:31.560
The second or third Dark God must be...

19:31.650 --> 19:32.650
Shut up!

19:34.690 --> 19:37.360
Well, I don't think he's done talking.

19:38.030 --> 19:39.990
Things that make me extend my overtime

19:40.070 --> 19:41.740
only have one end which is death!

19:45.410 --> 19:46.910
Dark Gods, huh?

19:47.000 --> 19:49.500
Looks like we've got
another tricky thing on our hands.

19:50.040 --> 19:50.960
All right.

19:51.040 --> 19:52.540
Let's hurry back.

19:56.130 --> 19:56.960
Leader!

19:57.050 --> 19:57.970
Jade!

19:58.300 --> 19:59.430
You're alive!

19:59.510 --> 20:01.720
Jade is alive!

20:02.600 --> 20:04.100
You stupid leader!

20:04.180 --> 20:05.770
We were so worried about you!

20:05.850 --> 20:08.100
I'm sorry.

20:09.020 --> 20:12.020
Thanks to you, Ms. Alina, we're all alive.

20:12.100 --> 20:13.190
Thank you.

20:14.520 --> 20:16.150
Thank you!

20:16.480 --> 20:17.780
Thank you.

20:19.990 --> 20:23.120
I left my work behind to come here.

20:23.200 --> 20:25.990
Thanks to you, I have
to work overtime again tomorrow.

20:27.370 --> 20:28.750
Well, that's fine.

20:29.210 --> 20:31.580
Even though I have
to work overtime again tomorrow,

20:32.210 --> 20:34.420
it was worth coming here.

20:36.920 --> 20:38.710
It's been a few days since then.

20:39.420 --> 20:41.720
Lululi, whose skills had been taken away,

20:41.800 --> 20:44.850
was able to regain them
after the dark god was destroyed.

20:44.930 --> 20:45.890
Lululi

20:45.970 --> 20:49.640
focused on healing Jade and Lowe
who were severely injured.

20:50.890 --> 20:54.310
And I thought after my identity
as the Executioner was exposed,

20:54.400 --> 20:56.650
I'd be fired.

20:57.980 --> 21:01.110
I've put a gag order on the guards.

21:01.950 --> 21:04.030
Thanks to the Guild Master's help,

21:04.120 --> 21:07.660
surprisingly, I was able
to return to my normal life.

21:09.040 --> 21:10.000
That's right.

21:10.080 --> 21:12.000
My normal life

21:13.000 --> 21:15.040
of working overtime every day.

21:17.920 --> 21:21.050
How long do I have to work overtime?

21:21.630 --> 21:23.180
It's just a boss, guys.

21:23.260 --> 21:25.010
Hurry up and defeat it.

21:26.600 --> 21:28.100
But

21:28.180 --> 21:31.180
the adventurers
are already trying their best, right?

21:32.310 --> 21:33.480
Ms. Alina.

21:35.100 --> 21:37.820
I'm still working overtime.

21:37.900 --> 21:39.320
I know.

21:39.400 --> 21:41.530
That's why I wanted to help.

21:41.610 --> 21:42.610
It's fine.

21:42.900 --> 21:45.450
Why are you so energetic?

21:45.530 --> 21:47.580
Shouldn't you be resting for a while?

21:48.120 --> 21:51.160
Where did all that energy come from?

21:53.290 --> 21:54.580
It's thanks to

21:55.290 --> 21:59.420
that bottle of love-filled magic potion
that Ms. Alina had drunk halfway!

21:59.500 --> 22:00.710
Die!

22:04.630 --> 22:05.680
Jade.

22:05.760 --> 22:06.590
What is it?

22:08.180 --> 22:10.930
I suppose you should lend me a hand.

22:11.310 --> 22:12.310
Are you sure?

22:12.680 --> 22:14.890
I need all the help I can get,

22:14.980 --> 22:16.730
so I can go home early and sleep!

22:16.810 --> 22:18.190
Well then, let's get started!

22:18.270 --> 22:19.270
All right!

23:53.030 --> 23:53.870
Next episode.

23:53.950 --> 23:58.210
I may be the Silver Sword's healer,
but I want to be healed too.

23:58.210 --> 24:00.210
(Next Episode: I May Be the Silver Sword's Healer,
But I Want To Be Healed Too)
